# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# RADIATION .gitignore — landed 2026-09-13 (P-10 Phase 0, containment patch)
# Purpose: make accidental publication of vehicles, binaries, and credentials
#          IMPOSSIBLE rather than merely discouraged.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── 1. CREDENTIALS — never, under any circumstance ───────────────────────────
# A Blackboard/LMS external-calendar feed URL grants full read access to the
# Commander's course calendar. It is a credential (P-10 §3.2). It enters no
# file that git can see.
schedule/
schedul*.txt
*ics.txt
*.ics
*.ical

# ── 2. VEHICLES — the documents are read and extracted, never committed ──────
# II.6 restraint doctrine, rule 8 (delete-the-binary, staged under P-04).
# The repo holds what the Commander KNOWS; vehicles stay on his machine.
syllabi/
courses_raw/
Brain/courses/_local/
*.pdf
*.docx
*.doc
*.pptx
*.xlsx
*.html
*.htm
SCHEDULE.png
desktop.ini
Thumbs.db

# ── 3. ARCHIVES & PATCHES — transported, not stored ─────────────────────────
*.zip
PATCH_*.zip
RADIATION_PATCH_*.zip

# ── 4. WORKING NOISE ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
node_modules/
